# qa/entity-shapes.config.yaml — declares YOUR project's entity conventions.
#
# Read by `python3 qa/mine-entity-shapes.py` to produce qa/entity-shapes.json,
# which the autonomic-layer hooks consume.
#
# Without this file (or with an empty one), the autonomic layer stays dormant —
# every hook silently resolves "no entity" and exits. Customize then run the
# miner to activate.
#
# Pattern placeholders the miner expands per-entity:
#   <Entity>         the CamelCase entity name (e.g. Customer)
#   <entity>         lowercase (e.g. customer)
#   <snake>          snake_case (e.g. customer_interaction)
#   <kebab>          kebab-case (e.g. customer-interaction)
#   <FeatureFolder>  the consumer-supplied UI folder hint (see ios_feature_folder_hints)
#
# All glob paths are relative to repo root unless absolute.
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# WORKED EXAMPLE — the FMM reference stack (PHP + iOS + MariaDB sync layer).
# Uncomment + customize for your project, OR replace wholesale.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

